# Raw API captures never enter the repo — scrubbed fixtures only. A Coinbase
# response can carry account ids, balances, addresses, and transaction hashes.
/captures
# CDP API key files as downloaded from the portal. The private key inside is a
# working credential; it belongs in the keychain, never on disk in a repo.
cdp_api_key*.json
*.pem
